A gentle wind circles around the caster, increasing carrying capacity by [64, 87, 104, 119, 132 (TL1-5; SP 100)], defense against projectiles by [16, 22, 27, 30, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)], pin immunity by [9%, 36%, 57%, 74%, 90% (TL1-5)] and stun immunity by [4%, 18%, 28%, 37%, 45% (TL1-5)].

At level 4 it also makes you levitate slightly above the ground, allowing you to ignore some traps.

At level 5 it also grants [5%, 10%, 15%, 20%, 25% (TL1-5)] movement speed and removes [2, 5, 7, 10, 12 (TL1-5)] fatigue.
